From 27ec7941cdfda9125a7c8727d1eac4da3f6d7a5d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leon Timmermans <fawaka@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 03:10:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] doc/man3/OSSL_CMP_exec_certreq.pod: fix the DESCRIPTION
 section header

Add a missing empty line between verbatim section and the DESCRIPTION
header in OSSL_CMP_exec_certreq.pod.  Without it, it is parsed
as ordinary text.

Fixes: 6a3579e190fd "CMP: add support for requesting cert template using genm/genp"
Reviewed-by: Eugene Syromiatnikov <esyr@openssl.org>
Reviewed-by: Nikola Pajkovsky <nikolap@openssl.org>
Merge-date: Wed Oct 28 09:44:33 2026
Merged-from: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/33266
(cherry picked from commit 769ef60ef7b132a2123b53d0236da1bae30ee93a)
---
 doc/man3/OSSL_CMP_exec_certreq.pod | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/doc/man3/OSSL_CMP_exec_certreq.pod b/doc/man3/OSSL_CMP_exec_certreq.pod
index 30b7f42f31a6..407c95bb74cf 100644
--- a/doc/man3/OSSL_CMP_exec_certreq.pod
+++ b/doc/man3/OSSL_CMP_exec_certreq.pod
@@ -49,6 +49,7 @@ OSSL_CMP_get1_certReqTemplate
  int OSSL_CMP_get1_certReqTemplate(OSSL_CMP_CTX *ctx,
                                    OSSL_CRMF_CERTTEMPLATE **certTemplate,
                                    OSSL_CMP_ATAVS **keySpec);
+
 =head1 DESCRIPTION
 
 This is the OpenSSL main API for Certificate Management Protocol (CMP) clients.
